  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 520.03 Forestry Notice and Application Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 520.03 Forestry Notice and Application Requirements. The project-specific information required by Env-Wt 310.01(c)(1) or Env-Wt 311.03(b)(11), as applicable, shall be as follows:\n\n(a) A construction sequence, the water quality techniques to be used, and a schedule for the project; and\n\n(b) A narrative showing how the project meets the water quality techniques and avoidance and minimization techniques of the Forestry BMPs, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
